Disney Dream Live Valley is out now in  Early Access on PC switch PlayStation  and Xbox and it's also included in Game  Pass and after a dozen hours in the game  here are 20 quick hitting tips to help  you keep your wardrobe stylish your  house fancy and your neighborhood full  of Disney and Pixar friends  the first thing you'll want to do is set  up Cloud saves enabling you to access  your save file across all platforms to  set up Cloud saves select the option  from the main menu and follow the steps  cooking food is a big part of Disney  Dream Life Valley and though you'll gain  new recipes for Missions you can happen  upon them by simply getting creative in  the kitchen so long as you use a  combination of new ingredients it's  likely you'll chance upon a new recipe  to add to the game's collection of over  100 different dishes  the best way to make money in the early  portion of the game is to sell food to  goofy at his farmers market like Stahl  high-end dishes can go for several  hundred coins or more and the  ingredients are more often free as they  grow around town or in your garden how's  that for profit margin  some of the story missions are locked  until you befriend enough neighbors plus  each neighbor has their own friendship  level with you ranging from 1 to 10. not  only does increasing these levels with  folks like goofy Remy and Scrooge McDuck  help unlock new missions but each  friendship level gives you rewards as  you level up that character the best way  to be social with others is to make  small talk every day bring them gifts  and ask them to hang out which makes  them tag along as a companion NPC and  steadily improves your friendship  together  as mentioned giving gifts is a great way  to get to know someone in Disney Dream  like Valley each neighbor will have  three items they're eager to receive  each day these could be particular food  items or Gems or something else entirely  interacting with each character will  tell you what they'd love to receive on  that day and giving them any of those  items dramatically improves your  friendship level just know that their  preferred gift will change each day and  you'll only receive the bonus the first  time you give them the item on any  particular day  in addition to many items showcased  around Scrooge's store you can select a  number of other clothing or Furniture  items by talking to Scrooge unlike  Animal Crossing ordering items is  instant no more having to wait until the  next day to get what you really want  often times digging and mining around  town will net you lumps of coal this may  seem like a throwaway item that gets in  the way of nabbing the good stuff but in  actuality you need coal to cook so don't  discard it  the number of items overall in Disney  Dream Life Valley is staggering from  recipe ingredients to minerals to  crafting items and more it can be  difficult to remember where each item  originates thankfully the game offers a  shortcut head into the collection menu  and highlight in item such as clay or  oregano you'll be told exactly where you  may find that item keep in mind most  items are not universally available  across all biomes this means some  crafted items recipes and other things  you may want to make might not be  available until you unlock the right  location in which you can find its  missing parts use the collection menu we  mentioned to ensure whatever it is you  want to build or cook is actually  already available to you  it's important to know where your  neighbors are at all times you know in  case you want to hang out or give them a  gift or complete a quest thankfully the  in-game map reveals character locations  in real time you'll see them move around  the map whenever you're looking at it  which helps you track them down quickly  and get on to the next part of your  adventure  unlocking Realms requires dream light  which operates sort of like Nook miles  in Animal Crossing they're earned by  completing a never-ending list of  challenges there are four available  Realms at launch in each door to one of  these Realms can be unlocked redeeming  dream life you should do these as soon  as possible as they open up new story  missions that end with characters like  Remy Wally and Moana moving into your  neighborhood more neighbors means more  friends which in turn means more things  to unlock  in addition to Bringing characters to  your town as neighbors you'll also want  to complete Realms because they teach  you new things and Grant you upgrades  for example during the Moana realm  missions you'll receive a free upgrade  to your pickaxe courtesy of Maui making  it able to break tougher rocks that may  drop crafting items or simply standing  your way each realm is a multi-purpose  mission that goes beyond simply  exploring a Disney World you may already  adore  this one took us by surprise in a good  way you can layer some furniture items  combining Furniture like this allows you  to build onto the foundation of nearly 1  000 Furniture items already in the game  at launch it makes it so that even if  two people like several of the same  in-house items they may end up with very  different styles which is a really  satisfying touch in a game like this  as you play through the game you'll  level up which most importantly improves  your stamina allowing you to mine garden  and perform other strenuous tasks for  longer periods without a break though as  we'll explain in the next section those  breaks aren't too intrusive anyway  when you run out of stamina you can  easily refill it in a few ways eating a  basic food item such as a piece of fruit  will replenish some stamina but to  refill the whole stamina bar at once  you'll need to head home simply stepping  inside your house but only your house  not your neighbor's homes will instantly  refill your stamina the world of Disney  dreamlike Valley can get a bit bigger  than the world of Animal Crossing so  this would be tedious if not for the  wishing well fast travel locations  you'll unlock in each biome use those to  get home faster and take a breather  filling your stamina bar is nice and  sometimes crucial but even better is  overfilling it you can do that by eating  high level meals such as Ratatouille  you'll see your stamina bar fill up in  blue as normal but then a second stamina  bar will fill past that in yellow making  you sort of like an overpowered boss in  a more combat heavy game but don't worry  in dream life Valley no one is coming  for your head  each friend you make can be assigned a  role which essentially acts as a buff to  the things you'll already be doing like  fishing Mining and gardening and you  should consider giving different friends  different roles so that you're always  receiving a buff just remember to  receive that particular buff you'll want  to be actively hanging out with that  friend who you've assigned the  corresponding role to  games like this love making you work  within stringent limitations to start  teaching you to chase upgrades one of  those upgrades you'll want fast is the  backpack upgrade trading some coins  while looking inside your backpack will  expand your inventory by another seven  slots which you can do up to three times  that means you can eventually double the  size of your backpack which comes in  handy when you're spending long days  foraging and crafting  one of the coolest features in dreamlike  Valley is the ease at which you can  customize your town simply by going into  the furniture menu while you're Outdoors  or indoors if you want to alter your  home lets you rearrange the town however  you see fit this includes totally  uprooting your home your neighbor's home  or even businesses the entire town is  yours to shuffle as much as you want and  you can do it all for free at any moment  whether you're looking for your Founders  pack Cosmetics or perhaps another  surprise it's a good idea to check your  mailbox often just like an animal  crossing you'll know you've got mail  when the mailbox flag is raised so if  you see it sticking up hurry over and  reveal what kind of gift or purchase  items you may have received and that's  it hit the comment section and let us  know some Secrets or tips that you found  during your time in dreamlike Valley  follow me on Twitter at Devonte Chisholm  and we'll see you in the next one  foreign  [Music]
 

